{
  "title": "Easy Tender Italian Chicken Pasta",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Italian dish featuring rosemary and chicken, perfect for a sick day, made in a kadhai with a focus on tender and grassy flavors, and sugar-free friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "diet": [
    "sugar-free",
    "gluten-free"
